        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' Belshasa eekwealsa Danieli hang'weaka oomng'i, nea geayiin gheata surumnyeanda dahaabu, ak geerugu ng'asheanda siipwaash ng'eanyiida aba badaydaanyi, bea gideaba gayghoah siideaba samwagu jea goombaliischi aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda.",
          "type": "text",
